      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KRIS BAR IMOGEN (4) has been out of the placings at her last couple but on the winners' heels when placing three back (25.63) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at this track. Can turn form around here. AMRON TOMMY (7) was strongly fancied last time and hit the ground running with a slick early split, giving a sight but could manage only second (28.43) at Bendigo over 500m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Will give a great sight again. HUSKY SARA LEE (6) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (28.92) in a Grade 5 at Bendigo. Has a good record at this journey. Should be in this for a long way. UTAH ICON (8) returns here as an each-way chance.",
